infinite-patch 1
# Serge Chaotic Resonator Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.375
  i steps 16
  i note0 50
  i note1 57
  i note2 62
  i note3 55
  i note4 50
